# Regression guard: the two-token Depend form (<name>.build <dir>) combined
# with forwarded options after '|'. The pipe parsing used to swallow both
# tokens as one filename ("Failed to find First.build ..build"), because only
# the no-pipe branch split name from directory.
Depend First.build ../Libs | depth=3

# The path form with options must keep working too.
Depend ../Libs/Second.build | tok

Assembly    TwoTokenApp
SourceFiles main
